@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ========================================================
### 1. AUTENTIKASI & KEAMANAN (AUTH & JWT)
### ========================================================

### 1.1 Login sebagai Toko Kopi Nusantara (Role: SELLER)
# @name loginSeller
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kopinusantara@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 1.2 Login sebagai Budi Santoso (Role: BUYER)
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 1.3 Registrasi Akun Pembeli Baru (Siti Aminah - Role: BUYER)
# @name registerBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Siti Aminah",
  "email": "siti@mail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "BUYER",
  "phoneNumber": "081299887766",
  "city": "Surabaya",
  "address": "Jl. Pemuda No. 45, Gubeng, Surabaya"
}

###

### 1.4 Uji Coba Validasi: Daftar Ulang dengan Email yang Sama
# Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request ("Email siti@mail.com sudah terdaftar!")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Siti Kloning",
  "email": "siti@mail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "BUYER"
}

###

### 1.5 Registrasi Akun Penjual Baru (Toko Buku Pintar - Role: SELLER)
# @name registerSeller
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Toko Buku Pintar",
  "email": "bukupintar@mail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "SELLER",
  "phoneNumber": "081344556677",
  "city": "Yogyakarta",
  "address": "Jl. Malioboro No. 10, Yogyakarta"
}

### ========================================================
### 2. KATALOG PRODUK PUBLIK (BEBAS AKSES / TANPA LOGIN)
### ========================================================

### 2.1 Ambil Semua Produk (Katalog Terbuka)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

###

### 2.2 Ambil Produk Tertentu (ID 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

###

### 2.3 Uji Pagination (Halaman 0, Ukuran 1 Barang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=0&size=1

###

### 2.4 Uji Sorting (Urutkan dari Harga Termahal ke Termurah)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sort=price,desc

###

### 2.5 Cari Produk Berdasarkan Kata Kunci Nama (?name=Gayo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?name=Gayo

###

### 2.6 Filter Produk Berdasarkan Kategori (?category=Minuman)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=Minuman

### ========================================================
### 3. PENGELOLAAN PRODUK OLEH TOKO (ROLE: SELLER)
### ========================================================

### 3.1 Uji Coba Satpam: Coba Tambah Produk TANPA Login
# Ekspektasi: 403 Forbidden!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Ilegal Tanpa Login",
  "price": 50000.0,
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "Minuman"
}

###

### 3.2 Uji Coba RBAC: Pembeli (BUYER) Nekat Menambah Produk Toko
# Ekspektasi: 403 Forbidden (Hanya SELLER yang berhak menambah produk!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Bajakan Milik Buyer",
  "price": 20000.0,
  "stock": 5,
  "category": "Minuman"
}

###

### 3.3 Penjual Resmi (SELLER) Tambah Produk Baru
# Ekspektasi: 201 Created (Otomatis memakai token Toko Kopi!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Toraja Sapan 250g",
  "price": 95000.0,
  "stock": 30,
  "category": "Minuman",
  "description": "Kopi Arabika Toraja Sapan dengan aroma floral dan dark chocolate.",
  "sku": "KOP-TOR-250G",
  "weightGram": 250
}

###

### 3.4 Uji Coba Satpam Validasi: Kirim Data Produk Rusak
# Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request dengan rincian pesan error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -50000.0,
  "stock": -10,
  "category": ""
}

###

### 3.5 Ubah Data Produk ID 1 (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika Premium (Diskon Promo)",
  "price": 75000.0,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "Minuman",
  "description": "Kopi single origin Gayo Aceh 100% Arabika harga promo spesial.",
  "sku": "KOP-GAYO-250G",
  "weightGram": 250
}

###

### 3.6 Hapus Produk ID 2 (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/2
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}

### ========================================================
### 4. TRANSAKSI BELANJA OLEH PEMBELI (ROLE: BUYER)
### ========================================================

### 4.1 Pembeli (Budi - BUYER) Checkout Belanja 2 Kopi Gayo (ID 1)
# Ekspektasi: 201 Created (ID Budi otomatis dicabut langsung dari token JWT!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingCourier": "JNE Reguler",
  "shippingCost": 18000.0,
  "paymentMethod": "BCA_VA",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

###

### 4.2 Cek Dampak Belanja: Stok Berkurang & Total Terjual Bertambah!
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

###

### 4.3 Uji Checkout Gagal: Beli Barang Melebihi Stok (Minta 500 Pcs!)
# Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request ("Stok tidak mencukupi...")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingCourier": "JNE Reguler",
  "shippingCost": 18000.0,
  "paymentMethod": "BCA_VA",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 500
    }
  ]
}

### ========================================================
### 5. LOGISTIK & PENGIRIMAN PESANAN
### ========================================================

### 5.1 Penjual Mengirim Pesanan (Status: SHIPPED)
# Ekspektasi: Status jadi SHIPPED & otomatis terbit nomor resi kurir!
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/status?status=SHIPPED
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}

###

### 5.2 Batalkan Pesanan (Status: CANCELLED) & Uji Auto-Restock
# Ekspektasi: Status CANCELLED & stok barang otomatis dikembalikan ke toko!
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/status?status=CANCELLED
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}


### ========================================================
### 6. ULASAN & RATING PRODUK (REVIEWS & RATINGS)
### ========================================================

### 6.1 Uji Coba RBAC: Toko (SELLER) Nekat Memberi Ulasan Sendiri
# Ekspektasi: 403 Forbidden! (Hanya BUYER yang boleh memberi review)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Toko sendiri memuji barang sendiri!"
}

###

### 6.2 Pembeli (Budi - BUYER) Beri Rating Bintang 5 untuk Kopi Gayo (ID 1)
# Ekspektasi: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Kopinya harum sekali, rasa asam buahnya pas! Pengiriman kilat."
}

###

### 6.3 Pembeli Baru (Siti - BUYER) Beri Rating Bintang 4 untuk Kopi Gayo (ID 1)
# Ekspektasi: 201 Created (Token otomatis dari registerBuyer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{registerBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Rasa mantap, sedikit kemanisan kalau dicampur susu tapi tetap enak."
}

###

### 6.4 Cek Dampak Rating pada Produk 1: Lihat ratingAvg dan reviewCount!
# Ekspektasi: ratingAvg berubah jadi 4.5 (hasil rata-rata dari 5 dan 4), reviewCount = 2!
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

###

### 6.5 Publik: Lihat Semua Ulasan pada Kopi Gayo (ID 1)
# Ekspektasi: 200 OK (Daftar semua testimoni pembeli beserta nama dan ratingnya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/product/1


### ========================================================
### 7. KERANJANG BELANJA PERSISTENT (SHOPPING CART)
### ========================================================

### 7.1 Uji Coba RBAC: Toko (SELLER) Coba Buka Keranjang Belanja
# Ekspektasi: 403 Forbidden! (Hanya akun bertiket BUYER yang punya keranjang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}

###

### 7.2 Pembeli (Budi) Tambah 2 Kopi Gayo (ID 1) ke Keranjang Belanja
# Ekspektasi: 200 OK, keranjang berisi 1 jenis barang (qty: 2, subtotal: Rp 170.000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### 7.3 Pembeli (Budi) Tambah 1 Teh Walini (ID 2) ke Keranjang Belanja
# Ekspektasi: 200 OK, totalItems = 3, totalPrice = Rp 195.000
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 2,
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### 7.4 Pembeli (Budi) Lihat Isi Keranjang Belanja Saya
# Ekspektasi: 200 OK, daftar barang belanjaan tersimpan permanen di database
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

###

### 7.5 Pembeli (Budi) Ubah Jumlah Teh Walini (ID 2) Menjadi 3 Pcs
# Ganti /items/2 dengan itemId yang sesuai dari respon GET keranjang
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/2?quantity=3
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

###

### 7.6 Pembeli (Budi) Hapus Teh Walini dari Keranjang Belanja
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/2
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

###

### 7.7 Uji Validasi: Beli Barang Melebihi Stok Toko (Minta 500 Pcs!)
# Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request ("Stok toko tidak mencukupi...")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 500
}


### ========================================================
### 8. KUPON DISKON & PROMO BELANJA (COUPONS & PROMOTIONS)
### ========================================================

### 8.1 Publik: Lihat Semua Kupon Promo yang Aktif
# Ekspektasi: 200 OK (Daftar kupon DISKON10 dan HEMAT20RB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/coupons

###

### 8.2 Cek Validasi Kupon Sebelum Checkout
# Ekspektasi: 200 OK, "discountAmount": 17000.0, "valid": true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/coupons/check?code=DISKON10&amount=170000

###

### 8.3 Pembeli (Budi) Checkout Belanja DENGAN Kupon Diskon Persen ("DISKON10")
# Ekspektasi: 201 Created!
# totalAmount: 170.000, discountAmount: 17.000, shippingCost: 18.000, grandTotal: 171.000!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingCourier": "JNE Reguler",
  "shippingCost": 18000.0,
  "paymentMethod": "BCA_VA",
  "couponCode": "DISKON10",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

###

### 8.4 Pembeli (Budi) Checkout Belanja DENGAN Kupon Potongan Tetap ("HEMAT20RB")
# Ekspektasi: 201 Created! discountAmount: 20.000
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingCourier": "SiCepat",
  "shippingCost": 15000.0,
  "paymentMethod": "GOPAY",
  "couponCode": "HEMAT20RB",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

### 8.5 Uji Validasi: Pakai Kupon Palsu / Asal-Asalan
# Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request ("Kupon dengan kode 'DISKONPALSU' tidak ditemukan!")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingCourier": "JNE Reguler",
  "shippingCost": 18000.0,
  "paymentMethod": "BCA_VA",
  "couponCode": "DISKONPALSU",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

### 8.6 Uji Validasi: Pakai Kupon Tapi Belanja Belum Mencapai Syarat Minimal
# Kupon HEMAT20RB syarat minimal belanja Rp 70.000, tapi beli Teh Walini hanya Rp 25.000!
# Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request ("Total belanja belum memenuhi syarat minimal belanja kupon...")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingCourier": "JNE Reguler",
  "shippingCost": 10000.0,
  "paymentMethod": "BCA_VA",
  "couponCode": "HEMAT20RB",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
